    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6380" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναγρᾰφ-εύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>recorder,</i> esp. as title of commissioners
			appointed to codify laws, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				1.61
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				30.2
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>registrar of decrees,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				2.192
			</span></i><i>c,</i> cf. <i><span class="en">
				191
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>plan, pattern, design,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				2.1054b33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				52.42
			</span></i>.</div>
